1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,382
To tell them apart in one line each: sodium hydroxide dissolves phenol but not ethanol.

2
00:00:07,382 --> 00:00:11,627
Sodium bicarbonate fizzes only with a carboxylic acid.

3
00:00:11,627 --> 00:00:15,859
And neutral ferric chloride turns violet only with phenol.

